-- הסכם ספטמבר 2013 (17.9.2013) — העותק המלא: a second copy of the agreement
-- of 17.9.2013, which the corpus publishes beside the registered scan
-- (`2013-09-17_ofek-hadash_september-2013-agreement`). Its words are the
-- registered copy's, with two differences: it carries no registration
-- stamp (so its preamble paragraphs are numbered one lower), and it prints
-- the whole of §15א, which §10(ב) adds to the base agreement and which the
-- registered scan breaks off in the middle of, page 5 being missing there.
--
-- So this file imports the registered copy's encoding and cites it for
-- every row the two share; what it encodes itself is §15א: role hours for
-- teachers who hold roles and teach grades 7–9 in a primary school. §15א
-- is §17א (§9(ב) of the agreement) for a primary school: the week of §15
-- in place of §17's, the classes of grades 7–9 in the school in place of
-- the junior high's, and no (ה), a primary school having no upper division.
-- It runs on the registered copy's role-hour rules (imported) with those
-- differences.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `2013-09-17_ofek-hadash_september-2013-agreement`

