§§ `10(ב) הוספת סעיף 15א להסכם הכולל — שעות תפקיד למורים בעלי תפקידים המלמדים בכיתות ז' עד ט' בבית ספר יסודי`

-- §15א opening: for teachers in a primary school with grades 7, 8 or 9 who
-- teach those classes and hold the roles listed, the week of §15 applies,
-- and their role hours, within the school, are allotted by (א)–(ג) — the
-- registered copy's `§15א reaches him`, which this copy completes.
-- (א): a grade coordinator of one of grades 7–9, the grade being of 4
-- classes or more, gets cumulatively (1) half an hour for each class of the
-- grade, at most 6, in place of frontal hours (§15(ב)), and (2) half an
-- hour for each class, at most the individual hours in his position, in
-- place of individual hours (§15(ג)). (ב): a social-education coordinator,
-- 0.4 hours for each class of grades 7, 8 and 9 in the school, in place of
-- frontal hours. (ג): the subject coordinators' pool, half an hour for each
-- class of grades 7–9 in the school, at most an hour to one of them, in
-- place of frontal hours. (ד): subject to the same minimum of actual
-- frontal hours as §17א(ד) — 12 in a full position; 50% of the tables'
-- frontal hours and at least 6 (grade) or 8 (subject, social-education)
-- otherwise — read as there (F-ofek-hadash-september-2013-b). There is no
-- (ה): no upper-division hours count.
--
-- A role holder under §15א is the registered copy's `role holder in grades
-- 7 to 9`, the classes counted being the school's classes of grades 7–9 and
-- his week by the tables §15's.
@ref akn:art_10__para_b
GIVEN r IS A `role holder in grades 7 to 9`
GIVETH A `role holder in grades 7 to 9`
DECIDE `the role holder as §15א counts him` r IS
    `a role holder` (r's `role in grades 7 to 9`) (r's `classes in the grade he coordinates`)
                    (r's `classes the role hours are counted on`) (r's `hours the principal allots from the pool`)
                    (r's `employed in a full position`) (r's `his week by the tables`) 0

GIVEN r IS A `role holder in grades 7 to 9`
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `the role holder's week under §15א` r IS
    `the role holder's week` (`the role holder as §15א counts him` r)

-- A primary school with three classes in each of grades 7–9 (9 in all). A
-- full-time grade coordinator of a 4-class grade: 2 hours in place of
-- frontal hours and 2 in place of individual ones, on §15's week of 26, 5
-- and 5 (imported).
#ASSERT `the role holder's week under §15א` (`a role holder` `a grade coordinator in grades 7 to 9` 4 9 0 TRUE `a primary teacher's full week` 0) EQUALS `a week of` 24 3 5
-- The social-education coordinator: 0.4 × 9 = 3.6 hours in place of
-- frontal hours; the subject coordinators' pool: 4.5 hours.
#ASSERT `the role holder's week under §15א` (`a role holder` `a social-education coordinator in grades 7 to 9` 0 9 0 TRUE `a primary teacher's full week` 0) EQUALS `a week of` 22.4 5 5
#ASSERT `the subject coordinators' pool of role hours` 9 EQUALS 4.5
-- No (ה): frontal hours elsewhere do not count toward the minimum here.
#ASSERT (    `the role holder's week under §15א` (`a role holder` `a social-education coordinator in grades 7 to 9` 0 40 0 TRUE `a primary teacher's full week` 3)
         EQUALS `a week of` 12 5 5)

